sound 27K.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Here, take this.
text With that said, Fuko holds out a cube of wood.
text I have seen this before. It's something used during art classes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why are you giving it to me?
sound 27L.aac
text @[Fuko]
text At the moment, it belongs to you.
sound 27M.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Well, then!
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Immediately after, she threads her way under my arm and runs away.
text In my confusion, I can only stand there and watch.
text Just as Fuko vanishes around the corner, a male student runs toward me.
text And just as Fuko did, he stops in front of me.
sound 27N.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Did someone just run past...? Hey, isn't that...
text @[Tomoya]
text Something you want?
sound 27O.aac
text @[Male Student]
text The thing you're holding. That.
text @[Tomoya]
text This?
text I look down at the block of wood.
sound 27P.aac
text @[Male Student]
text So that's what happened... Okazaki, you're the real culprit.
text @[Tomoya]
text Of what?
sound 27Q.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Just how low can you stoop, using a girl like that to steal from us?
sound 27R.aac
text @[Male Student]
text You are a total piece of human trash.
text @[Tomoya]
text Sorry, I couldn't hear you very well. Care to repeat that, please?
text I don't miss my chance to apply the glaring technique.
sound 27S.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Eek!
text @[Tomoya]
text Did you say something about human trash?
sound 27T.aac
text @[Male Student]
text No, not at all... Okazaki-kun's always such a n-nice guy!
text That doesn't make me happy at all...
sound 27U.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But you see, I'm in trouble without the cube in your hand.
text @[Tomoya]
text So you want this thing?
text I throw the block of wood up in the air and catch it with one hand.
sound 27V.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Yes, yes, very much.
sound 27W.aac
text @[Male Student]
text A girl suddenly came during my art class and stole it...
sound 27X.aac
text @[Male Student]
text She just appeared out of nowhere, said to me 'So you don't need this? Thank you very much,' and took the wood piece, all within a single second.
sound 27Y.aac
text @[Male Student]
text There's no way I didn't need it, right? Haha.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that so.
sound 27Z.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Yeah, so please give it back.
text @[Tomoya]
text This is something I picked up. You see, it was just lying around there.
sound 280.aac
text @[Male Student]
text What...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Where was it again... Right, inside the trash can.
text @[Tomoya]
text If I hadn't picked it up, it would have been thrown away.
text @[Tomoya]
text So, it's fine to say this belongs to me now, right?
text I turn my back on the male student.
sound 281.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But I'm in serious trouble without it.
text Ignoring him, I start walking away.
